Subject: [PATCH 23/31] arm64: dts: r8a7796: Add INTC-EX device node
Date: Fri, 20 Oct 2017 12:28:26 +0200
Message-Id: <fdceea3c2ade76d929725fdd6211feb52bdf705a.1508495040.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
In-Reply-To: <cover.1508495040.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
